ia en la arquitectura de 4.0.0, qué cambios rompen un despliegue 3.8.0, cómo actualizar paso a paso una release de Helm y cómo validar el resultado.",{"_121":613},"upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0.mdx","es:upgrades",{"_254":616},"upgrades/meta.json","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-arrow-up shrink-0 text-[#c8861f]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 12-4-4-4 4\"></path><path d=\"M12 16V8\"></path></svg>","fallback"]
